{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120317001:1":{"text":"薬作りなら、やっぱり専門の場所に行って専門の設備を使わんとな。","source_cn":"制药这种事，还是要到专业的地方，使用专业的设备才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2991276D09247B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120317002:1":{"text":"っちゅうことは当然、ワイの家の設備を使うんや。","source_cn":"那当然就是在下家里的这些设备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88C7ACFC43A8AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120317003:1":{"text":"それって、目の前にあるこのオンボロのお鍋のことですか？","source_cn":"你指的是面前的这口老旧的锅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9CE7DDDEEE98DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120317004:1":{"text":"こいつを見くびったらあかん！この鍋についてる跡は、薬作りが上手くいった勲章なんやからな。","source_cn":"不要小看它！这上面所有的痕迹，可都是成功药剂后留下的勋章啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x001767C363C12C94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120317005:1":{"text":"粗末で、あんまり専門っぽく見えないがな。","source_cn":"那你的专业制药设备，看起来有确实有些不专业，还很简陋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC632B1DFEAA707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120317006:1":{"text":"おやぁ、粗末なわけあるかいな。ただちょっと簡素なだけや！それに鍋みたいなもんは使えさえすればええやろ。","source_cn":"哎呀，这怎么能叫简陋呢，只是比较简约罢了！而且锅这种东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC73CFF8F9AB7BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120317007:1":{"text":"この人は……さっきは「専門の設備」とかって言ってたのに……","source_cn":"这个家伙……明明刚刚还在说什么“专业的设备”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA390064F64DEC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120317008:1":{"text":"はいはい静かに、薬作りを始めるで。アンタらがやっとの思いで採ってきた薬草を混ぜて煎じて……","source_cn":"安静安静，我要开始正式制药了。这些是你们刚刚好不容易摘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C40EE43A8A3AA02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120317009:1":{"text":"それから秘密の素材を加えて……","source_cn":"然后加入的秘密配方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E5FD22E30F1F416","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120317010:1":{"text":"ほな、混ぜてや！","source_cn":"来，帮我搅拌一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A1733A10CA4F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"アクン","source":"阿熏"